              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simoni Petero abaza Yesu ati, “Mukama, waitu noija kugya nkahai?” Yesu amuhorora ati, “Mbali ndikugya mbwenu aha toina kumponderayo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
